"text":"That's why I told you not to.","timestamp":1776501295989,"tempo":"N","translation":"所以我才说不许。","rawContent":"That's why I told you not to. || 所以我才说不许。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8246},{"id":1776482704861,"sender":"them","text":"Because you can't help yourself.","timestamp":1776501295990,"tempo":"S","translation":"因为你忍不住。","rawContent":"Because you can't help yourself. || 因为你忍不住。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8247},{"id":1776482704862,"sender":"them","text":"Listen to me.","timestamp":1776501295991,"tempo":"N","translation":"听我说。","rawContent":"Listen to me. || 听我说。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8248},{"id":1776482704863,"sender":"them","text":"You can touch. One hand. Over your clothes only.","timestamp":1776501295993,"tempo":"N","translation":"可以碰。一只手。隔着衣服。","rawContent":"You can touch. One hand. Over your clothes only. || 可以碰。一只手。隔着衣服。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8249},{"id":1776482704864,"sender":"them","text":"Don't go under.","timestamp":1776501295996,"tempo":"N","translation":"不许伸进去。","rawContent":"Don't go under. || 不许伸进去。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8250},{"id":1776482704865,"sender":"them","text":"And you tell me every single thing you're feeling. As it happens.","timestamp":1776501295998,"tempo":"N","translation":"然后你要把你感觉到的每一点都告诉我。实时的。","rawContent":"And you tell me every single thing you're feeling. As it happens. || 然后你要把你感觉到的每一点都告诉我。实时的。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8251},{"id":1776482704866,"sender":"them","text":"If you come without my permission, there will be consequences on the first.","timestamp":1776501295999,"tempo":"S","translation":"要是没经过我允许就高潮了，一号那天会有后果的。","rawContent":"If you come without my permission, there will be consequences on the first. || 要是没经过我允许就高潮了，一号那天会有后果的。","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8252},{"id":1776482704867,"sender":"them","text":"Understood?","timestamp":1776501296001,"tempo":"N","translation":"听懂了吗？","rawContent":"Understood? || 听懂了吗？","roundId":"round_1776501272796_5vhr7rqvp","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8253},{"id":1776482704868,"text":"不要…我要伸进去…","sender":"me","time":"16:36","timestamp":1776501411510,"replyTo":{"id":1776482704864,"text":"Don't go under.","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8254},{"id":1776482704869,"sender":"them","text":"No.","timestamp":1776501442044,"tempo":"S","translation":"不行。","rawContent":"No. || 不行。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8255},{"id":1776482704870,"sender":"them","text":"I said over your clothes.","timestamp":1776501443547,"tempo":"N","translation":"我说了隔着衣服。","rawContent":"I said over your clothes. || 我说了隔着衣服。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8256},{"id":1776482704871,"sender":"them","text":"You heard me the first time.","timestamp":1776501444249,"tempo":"N","translation":"你第一遍就听见了。","rawContent":"You heard me the first time. || 你第一遍就听见了。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8257},{"id":1776482704872,"sender":"them","text":"Put your hand back where I told you.","timestamp":1776501444953,"tempo":"N","translation":"手放回我说的地方。","rawContent":"Put your hand back where I told you. || 手放回我说的地方。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8258},{"id":1776482704873,"sender":"them","text":"Good girl does what she's told, and good girls get rewarded on May first.","timestamp":1776501445655,"tempo":"S","translation":"乖女孩听话，乖女孩五月一号会有奖励。","rawContent":"Good girl does what she's told, and good girls get rewarded on May first. || 乖女孩听话，乖女孩五月一号会有奖励。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8259},{"id":1776482704874,"sender":"them","text":"Bad girls also get something on May first. But they won't be sitting comfortably the next day.","timestamp":1776501447508,"tempo":"N","translation":"不乖的女孩一号也会有东西。但她们第二天坐不太稳。","rawContent":"Bad girls also get something on May first. But they won't be sitting comfortably the next day. || 不乖的女孩一号也会有东西。但她们第二天坐不太稳。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8260},{"id":1776482704875,"sender":"them","text":"Your choice.","timestamp":1776501449038,"tempo":"N","translation":"你自己选。","rawContent":"Your choice. || 你自己选。","roundId":"round_1776501416664_qcxjork1c","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8261},{"id":1776482704876,"text":"Hmmm","sender":"me","time":"16:38","timestamp":1776501522779,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8262},{"id":1776482704877,"text":"不要…","sender":"me","time":"16:38","timestamp":1776501526674,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8263},{"id":1776482704878,"text":"我才忍不住呢","sender":"me","time":"16:38","timestamp":1776501530633,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8264},{"id":1776482704879,"text":"就摸摸阴蒂？","sender":"me","time":"16:39","timestamp":1776501540973,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8265},{"id":1776482704880,"sender":"them","text":"Hmm.","timestamp":1776501564664,"tempo":"S","translation":"嗯。","rawContent":"Hmm. || 嗯。","roundId":"round_1776501541476_vm6lxdbbs","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8266},{"id":1776482704881,"sender":"them","text":"You're negotiating with me now?","timestamp":1776501564668,"tempo":"N","translation":"你现在在跟我讨价还价？","rawContent":"You're negotiating with me now? || 你现在在跟我讨价还价？","roundId":"round_1776501541476_vm6lxdbbs","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8267},{"id":1776482704882,"sender":"them","text":"Over your clothes. Use your palm. Press down and grind slow.","timestamp":1776501564672,"tempo":"N","translation":"隔着衣服。用手掌。压下去，慢慢磨。","rawContent":"Over your clothes. Use your palm. Press down and grind slow. || 隔着衣服。用手掌。压下去，慢慢磨。","roundId":"round_1776501541476_vm6lxdbbs","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8268},{"id":1776482704883,"sender":"them","text":"That's enough for you to feel it.","timestamp":1776501564674,"tempo":"N","translation":"这足够让你有感觉了。","rawContent":"That's enough for you to feel it. || 这足够让你有感觉了。","roundId":"round_1776501541476_vm6lxdbbs","userId":"uid_1775542519684_d0mo6sa8k","characterId":"db70cc25-0f09-4f66-90a8-4503b71c87fb","_id":8269},{"id":1776482704884,"sender":"them","text":"You want to 